      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-2387-2399">やがて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2399-2414"><rb>退</rb><rt>しさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2414-2423">りて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2423-2435"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2435-2438">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2438-2453"><rb>支</rb><rt>つか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2453-2471">へ、は、は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2471-2495"><rb>申上</rb><rt>まをしあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2495-2498">げ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2498-2519"><rb>奉</rb><rt>たてまつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2519-2525">る。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2525-2540"><rb>應</rb><rt>おう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2540-2543">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2543-2558"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2558-2576">とぢや、とお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2576-2597"><rb>待兼</rb><rt>まちか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2597-2603">ね。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2603-2636"><rb>名道人</rb><rt>めいだうじん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2636-2654"><rb>謹</rb><rt>つゝし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2654-2663">んで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2663-2684"><rb>微妙</rb><rt>いみじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2684-2705">うもおはしまし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2705-2726"><rb>候</rb><rt>さふらふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2726-2741">ものかな。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2741-2765"><rb>妙齡</rb><rt>としごろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2765-2768">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2768-2783"><rb>至</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2783-2789">らせ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2789-2804"><rb>給</rb><rt>たま</rt>